`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
The checker needs to distinguish patterns that cannot match the subject, guards that admit no values, and arms already covered by earlier arms. Those produce three different tags.

Coverage also needs a “certain” set: an unreadable guard or `== name` pattern cannot prove coverage. I’ll keep that separate from what an arm could match.
