The executable produces the specification-derived tag set for all 13 supplied cases. That includes c07’s rebinding error and c11’s two diagnostics: an unbound variable and incomplete coverage of `term`.

`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
Integer intervals and tuple subtraction let the checker prove coverage without sampling values. Impossible pattern bindings carry an empty value set, which also avoids inventing a return-type error for c12’s vacuous arm.
